  "prefLabel": "Phy 401.07 Continuing professional education or professional activity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 401.07 “Continuing professional education or professional activity” means structured courses, activities, and experiences beyond entry-level professional preparation that are designed to maintain knowledge of advancements and enhancements in the field of physical therapy.\n\nSource. #9456, eff 4-17-09; renumbered by #10061 (from Phy 401.04); ss by #12088, eff 1-20-17",
